          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Sydney",
            "title": "Sydney",
            "content": "<p>A decade ago, two designers crossed paths in a shared workspace. United by a passion for thoughtful design and well-crafted products, they set out to challenge the idea that tech accessories had to be purely functional and lacking in inspiration.<\/p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "New York",
            "title": "New York",
            "content": "<p>They later established a new workspace in New York, designed to be as functional as it is visually refined. The space embodies a clear emphasis on simplicity, mirroring the design philosophy behind their work.<\/p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item-3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Tokyo",
            "title": "Tokyo",
            "content": "<p>The opening of a new studio in Tokyo had been in the works for some time. Today, the team is settling into a freshly designed space that serves as both a creative workspace and a showroom - located in the heart of a lively, design-forward neighborhood.<\/p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item-4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "label": "San Francisco",
            "title": "San Francisco",
            "content": "<p>Keeping in mind that crafting everyday solutions for an audience have to be also global, settle down in the US was obvious to them. And San Francisco is exactly the right spot.<\/p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
